  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_chiave",
      "name": {
        "en": "Chiave's Badge",
        "zh": "贾维证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_chiave",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Chiave has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for preemptive penetration of the battlefield situation and active offense so as to secure leeway for deployment.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall hereby be appointed a Vanguard Operator during field operations to exercise Pioneer responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员贾维擅长抢先切入战局，通过进攻争取部署空间\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为先锋干员，行使尖兵职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_chiave",
      "name": {
        "en": "Homemade Jack",
        "zh": "自制千斤顶",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "Y",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_chiave",
      "description": {
        "en": "Chiave's been taking notice of that girl for a while now.\nShe's a Lupo, not the kind that attracts attention at first sight, but she's got a pair of sharp, twitchy ears, and they always stand up whenever she's face-to-face with him. She's withdrawn but decently polite, seems to be a well-raised young lady, but none of that's what he's really focused on.\nNo, Chiave's started noticing her because she keeps coming to the garage, but she's got nothing to fix. Not just that, but she keeps walking over to him, asking him questions about work. She struck him as the annoying sort of amateur, the kind he'd just say a few words to get off his back. Later, though, something made him change his mind about her: a customer came complaining to his boss about how Chiave installed vertical jets and sprayed graffiti on his car without permission while fixing it up, and filed it all under repair costs. The girl made herself known at that point, said she thought Chiave's mods were super sick, and even footed the compensation for him.\n'Huh, this chick's got some taste,' was Chiave's mental comment.\nOne day, she shows up in front of Chiave again, this time with a fancy cake for him. He wants to refuse her, but she says, 'I'll get fat if I eat too much cake, so I may as well give the rest to you,' pushing him to begrudgingly accept it. He's surprised to find, though, that he's had this kind of cake before, and it's his favorite. He's got a million thanks for the girl, so he decides to get her a precious gift in return, the likes of which have never been seen before. He explains his idea his buds—Broca and Aosta—and asks them to help out. Broca's naturally on planning and prototyping duty, and Aosta's not so convinced by Chiave's proposition, but reluctantly designs the exterior and gives input on some of the finer details, while Chiave himself handles the imagination bomb he's throwing down in the making of it all. Finally, after working several nights straight, the three's masterpiece of blood and sweat is ready to see the light of day.\nThe next time the girl visits the garage, everything plays out as they envisioned. With music playing that Broca put on in advance, Chiave (with some effort) presents her with the gift, and recites his speech: 'You like it? It's a jack I made especially for you! Even if you get fatter now, you can hoist yourself up into your car with this. You'll never need to worry about packing on weight again.'\nAnd since then, not once has the girl been seen at the garage again. But in the Chiave Gang's collection, there is now an unusually shaped, repainted jack, serving as an heirloom of the Chiave Gang to be forever stowed away.",
        "zh": "贾维注意到那名女生有段时间了。\n那是一名鲁珀女生，从外形上看并不是引人注目的类型，却有着一对灵巧的尖耳，与贾维对视时常常会竖起来。女生举止拘谨但礼节得当，似乎是名受过良好教育的闺秀，不过这不是引起他注意的关键。\n贾维开始注意到她，是因为她常来到修车厂，却没有要修理的设备。不仅如此，她还经常走到贾维身边，询问一些有关他工作的问题。贾维认为女生相当外行且烦人，恨不得三言两语敷衍了事。不过之后的一件事让贾维对她有所改观：一位客户向贾维的老板投诉，原因是贾维在维修时擅自给他的车加装了垂直喷射引擎并在车身喷漆涂鸦，还将费用算入了维修费中。这时，那名女生站了出来，表示她觉得贾维的改装非常酷，并替他支付了全部赔偿。\n“这家伙，还是有点品味的。”贾维如此评价道。\n某天，她又出现在了贾维面前，这一次她带给他一份精美的蛋糕。他本想拒绝女生的好意，但听见她说：“蛋糕吃多了会长胖，只好把多余的蛋糕送给你啦。”只好勉为其难地接受了。然而出乎他意料的是，这块蛋糕是他吃过最好吃的食物。贾维对女生满怀感激，决定要准备一个前所未有的珍贵礼物回赠予她。他向他的伙伴们——布洛卡与奥斯塔阐述了他的点子，请求他们的帮助。布洛卡自然地承担了原型设计，而奥斯塔，虽然对贾维的点子感到疑惑，但还是勉为其难地帮忙设计了外观，并在一些细节上提出了意见，贾维本人则负责在制作中尽情发挥想象力。终于，在经过数个通宵后，这件凝结了三人心血的大作成功面世。\n下一次女生来到厂里时，一切都如他们设想的那样进行。在布洛卡提前播放的音乐中，贾维把礼物搬到了女生面前，讲出了准备已久的话：“喜欢吗？这是我亲手为你制作的千斤顶！以后就算你吃得再胖，也可以用这个把你抬起来送上车，再也没有长胖的烦恼了。”\n从此以后，再也没人在修车厂看见过这名女生的身影。而在贾维团伙的小金库中，出现了一个造型奇特、重新涂装过的千斤顶，作为贾维团伙的传家宝而被永久封藏。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
